{{short description|None}}

Mongolia joined the [[Ramsar Convention]]  on [[Wetlands]] of International Importance Especially as [[Waterfowl]] Habitat on April 8, 1998. There are currently 11 wetlands designated as [[Ramsar site]]s in Mongolia.<ref name="Ramsar list">{{cite web|title=Ramsar List|url=http://www.ramsar.org/pdf/sitelist.pdf|publisher=Ramsar.org|access-date=31 March 2013}}</ref>
{{GeoGroup}}{{clear}}

